commit df041d2d04eafc114ef7269bf652d179a967df13

C03: a joke may carry its question; the free-content contract only rejects a reply that ends by asking (KNOWLEDGE1355)

KNOWLEDGE1353 measured: the free_content shape produced real jokes («¿Por qué el lechón nunca se enoja? Porque…», «Why don't skeletons fight each other? They don't have the guts!») and the contract vetoed the question mark and the line break inside them, so the turns fell back to asking which kind. The contract now accepts a question inside the content and one line break; a reply that ends by asking the person (even before a trailing emoji) still misses it.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


